  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Steps to reproduce (on Chrome):",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1. Create a binary with fileA.jpg",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "2. Create version v1.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "3. Update binary with fileB.jpg",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "4. Create version v2.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "5. Click on versions link and click on v1 link.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "6. Click \"Revert to this Version\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "7. Return to binary resource metadata page. Notice the file associated with the version fileB.jpg rather than the expected fileA.jpg. It does not appear that the version was reverted.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The problem can be resolved with a hard refresh.  However a refresh should not be required.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
